232
00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:14.400
- Made in Lannisport. of course.

233
00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:14.400
- Of course.

234
00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:19.210
The Kingswood.

235
00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:19.210
it's fine hunting ground.

236
00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:21.750
But the best spot is to be

237
00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:21.750
